+### [NeuS](6060-neus.md)
+NeuS is a volume rendering technique designed for multi-view surface reconstruction that improves geometric quality by disentangling geometry and appearance using a neural implicit signed distance function (SDF). It differs from standard NeRF-like methods by modeling the scene as a surface via a softplus-based density approximation of the SDF, and from explicit surface methods by avoiding the need for explicit mesh extraction during training, instead rendering differentiable images directly from the implicit field.
 
-### [Plenoxels](5942-plenoxels.md)
